{"id":"29a1e5bf3eb93726","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure.md","title":"Standard Arithmetic Structure and Order Bridge","display":"df-standard-arithmetic-structure — Standard Arithmetic Structure and Order Bridge","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure","aliases":["88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure"],"display":"df-standard-arithmetic-structure — Standard Arithmetic Structure and Order Bridge","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-function]]","[[88-df-iota-operator]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-standard-arithmetic-structure — Standard Arithmetic Structure and Order Bridge"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为 ZFC；自然数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,n+1,+,\\cdot,&lt;\">\\(0,n+1,+,\\cdot,&lt;\\)</span> 为元层运算与次序。对象语言签名及同形符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 及解释投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 是下述标准解释谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 由其唯一见证指定。唯一描述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"03af5095ed087251\" href=\"?note=03af5095ed087251\" title=\"88-df-iota-operator\">88-df-iota-operator</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(x=v_0^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=v_1^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(y=v_1^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=v_2^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(z=v_2^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> 两两不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 是对象语言句子，不是对原公理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 的修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)=\\mathbb N\\land0^{\\mathfrak A}=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathsf s^{\\mathfrak A}(n)=n+1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(+^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m+n\\land\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m\\cdot n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land&lt;^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m&lt;n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)=\\mathbb N\\land0^{\\mathfrak A}=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathsf s^{\\mathfrak A}(n)=n+1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(+^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m+n\\land\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m\\cdot n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land&lt;^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m&lt;n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\iota\\mathfrak A\\,\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\iota\\mathfrak A\\,\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,\\bigl(x&lt;y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\;(x+\\mathsf s(z)=y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,\\bigl(x&lt;y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\;(x+\\mathsf s(z)=y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>签名只有所列常量、函数和关系符号，所以这些解释条件唯一确定结构的全部四个坐标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 不再是未定义的“标准模型”名称。</p>\n<p>本册保留的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 恰有七条公理，未约束签名中的原始关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>。因此使用含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的有界公式时，需要显式的次序桥接条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 只为该条件命名，不把它悄悄加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-iota-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景为 ZFC；自然数的 $0,n+1,+,\\cdot,<$ 为元层运算与次序。对象语言签名及同形符号见 [[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 及解释投影见 [[88-df-structure]]；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}$ 及解释投影见 [[88-df-structure]]；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-iota-operator","status":"resolved","id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)$ 是下述标准解释谓词；$\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 由其唯一见证指定。唯一描述 $\\iota$ 见 [[88-df-iota-operator]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"0,n+1,+,\\cdot,<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"x=v_0^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"y=v_1^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"z=v_2^{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)=\\mathbb N\\land0^{\\mathfrak A}=0\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathsf s^{\\mathfrak A}(n)=n+1\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(+^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m+n\\land\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}(m,n)=m\\cdot n\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land<^{\\mathfrak A}=\\{\\langle m,n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^2:m<n\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathfrak A\\;\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\iota\\mathfrak A\\,\\mathrm{StdArith}(\\mathfrak A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}standard\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\\forall y\\,\\bigl(x<y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\;(x+\\mathsf s(z)=y)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":2675,"backlinks":[{"id":"96e88157ef117acf","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"签名元组及符号集见 [[88-df-language]]、[[88-df-symbol]]；标准算术结构和次序桥接句见 [[88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure]]。"},{"id":"d42c50d86a16e6af","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 与 $\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 的完整定义见 [[88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\